            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00237:alt:fig-00003-alt",
              "text": "Various C 13 shifts: propionic acid (alpha carbon at 181); benzoic acid (carbonyl at 173, benzenes at 128 to 134), but-2-enoic acid (carbonyl at 172), and propionitrile (nitrile at 121)."
            },
            "src": "../../media/OChem_20_08_003.jpg",
            "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
